misation=0\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<p><img alt=\"The Talo features modular sections that can each hold handy tools for hiking\" src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/ab78c46/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1350x900+0+0/resize/1350x900!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F5e%2F83%2Fbf24e59441449637dbdb199894d0%2Fthe-talo-features-modular-sections-that-can-each-handy-tools-for-hiking.jpg\" /><p>I'm always happy to discover outdoor gear that's designed to take up less room and allow you to pack light. This trekking pole falls squarely in that category, and does a lot more than you'd expect at first glance.</p><p><a href=\"https://newatlas.com/outdoor-gear/modular-talo-trekking-pole/\">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/outdoor-gear/\">Gear</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/outdoors/\">Outdoors</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/hiking/\" rel=\"tag\">Hiking</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/camping/\" rel=\"tag\">Camping</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/tools/\" rel=\"tag\">Tools</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/xxkickbooster/\" rel=\"tag\">xxKickbooster</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/kickstarter/\" rel=\"tag\">Kickstarter</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/modular/\" rel=\"tag\">Modular</a></p>",
