      "title": "[New Atlas] Durston's Dyneema X-Dome tent claims 'world's lightest' title",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/e239690/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1574x826+0+26/resize/1200x630!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff1%2F2c%2F1ec222fa47258a7211796886b005%2Fscreenshot-2026-08-14-at-2-58-40-pm.png&amp;na.image_optimisation=0\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/e239690/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1574x826+0+26/resize/1200x630!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff1%2F2c%2F1ec222fa47258a7211796886b005%2Fscreenshot-2026-08-14-at-2-58-40-pm.png&amp;na.image_optimisation=0\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/e239690/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1574x826+0+26/resize/1200x630!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff1%2F2c%2F1ec222fa47258a7211796886b005%2Fscreenshot-2026-08-14-at-2-58-40-pm.png&amp;na.image_optimisation=0\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/e239690/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1574x826+0+26/resize/1200x630!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff1%2F2c%2F1ec222fa47258a7211796886b005%2Fscreenshot-2026-08-14-at-2-58-40-pm.png&amp;na.image_optimisation=0\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/e239690/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1574x826+0+26/resize/1200x630!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff1%2F2c%2F1ec222fa47258a7211796886b005%2Fscreenshot-2026-08-14-at-2-58-40-pm.png&amp;na.image_optimisation=0\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/e239690/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1574x826+0+26/resize/1200x630!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff1%2F2c%2F1ec222fa47258a7211796886b005%2Fscreenshot-2026-08-14-at-2-58-40-pm.png&amp;na.image_optimisation=0\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/e239690/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1574x826+0+26/resize/1200x630!/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff1%2F2c%2F1ec222fa47258a7211796886b005%2Fscreenshot-2026-08-14-at-2-58-40-pm.png&amp;na.image_optimisation=0\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<p><img alt=\"The carbon fiber exo-frame allows for flexible setup\" src=\"https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/697c470/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1574x878+0+0/resize/1440x803!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff1%2F2c%2F1ec222fa47258a7211796886b005%2Fscreenshot-2026-08-14-at-2-58-40-pm.png\" /><p>When ultralight backpacking boutique Durston Gear launched the X-Dome 1+ freestanding tent in 2024, anyone familiar with the brand knew it wasn't going to be the lightest in the series. That's because Durston has an established history of going even lighter (and more expensive) with Dyneema \"Pro\" models of its shelters. So we've been waiting, and now it's here: The X-Dome Pro 1+ debuts to claims of being \"world's lightest freestanding double-wall tent,\" and it looks like an exceptional piece of gear for any backpacking or ultralight kit.</p><p><a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tents/durston-worlds-lightest-x-dome-tent/\">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tents/\">Tents</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/outdoor-gear/\">Gear</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/outdoors/\">Outdoors</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/tent/\" rel=\"tag\">Tent</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/durston-gear/\" rel=\"tag\">durston-gear</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/backpacking/\" rel=\"tag\">Backpacking</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/bikepacking/\" rel=\"tag\">Bikepacking</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/camping/\" rel=\"tag\">Camping</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/dyneema/\" rel=\"tag\">Dyneema</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/lightweight/\" rel=\"tag\">Lightweight</a>, <a href=\"https://newatlas.com/tag/worlds-lightest/\" rel=\"tag\">World&apos;s Lightest</a></p>",
